host  problems he's being ignored by the love  of his life violet  or love of his death if we want to get  literal because she found out he shot up  a school  and impregnated her mother she's violet  he's a changed man get over it  madison and behold interrupt the session  they seem to know all about ben and tate  behold even brings up that ben's wife  vivian died giving birth to michael  he's the child of a human vivien and  spirit  tate if you remember from season one  billy dean howard medium to the stars  predicted the very nature of the  antichrist  a child born of human and spirit  will usher in the end of times  it is the essence of evil tate warns  them that  even people protected from magic aren't  safe in this house  but madison and behold aren't going to  leave empty-handed they promise to get  out of the spirit's hair as long as they  answer some questions  but the house has a few tricks up its  sleeve as a creepy red ball  drops from the stairs madison is tackled  by bow constant langdon's handsome son  she kept locked in the attic he shoot  off madison by none other than billy  dean who we learn is alive being allowed  to walk freely in and out of the house  unharmed by the spirits and then we get  one of the most  epic moments so far this season the  return of constance langdon who says  and this is my [ __ ] house  madison behold make their intentions  known to constance who doesn't seem  too pleased they're there they're  interrupted by moira o'hara yet another  character from season 1 who had sex with  constance's husband  and was subsequently killed for it and  judging by constance's back and forth  with her she's still not over it  madison behold questioned constance and  billy about michael  she doesn't give away info for free if  they can abracadabra that [ __ ] moira  out of the house  constance will tell them everything they  need to know so they do the only logical  thing and dig up her body in the  backyard  they uncover a skull but it's no