 where he was going  distraught and feeling betrayed by god  she ventures into the murder house and  commit suicide  od on pills and alcohol she never wanted  to see michael again  upon her awakening she finds three of  her children waiting for her  addie noticeably absent because if you  remember from season one she did not die  in the house rather was brutally run  over by a car on halloween  after she tells her story she's  interrupted by her daughter who  inexplicably has no eyes before fading  away  and thank god there was a commercial  break after this scene because we then  see ben harmon tearjerking it in what  has to be the saddest happy ending ever  madison behold promise him if he tells  them what he knows about michael they  can fix his  crying problems michael uncovers his  grandmother's body and ben  tells him her grandmother doesn't want  to see him the spirits in this house can  only be seen when they want to be seen  ben wants to help him he can't help but  think of him as his own son  even though biologically he isn't in a  sweet little montage  they do fun things like play catch and  make crosses on rubik's cubes when  michael meets his real dad  stay away from my [ __ ] you understand  it's heartwarming to say the least  papa tate makes tater tot cry saying not  even himself could make something as  monstrous as michael michael turns away  from good and embraces the dark side  performing gruesome  surgeries in the basement when the house  sells he kills the new owners showing no  remorse but even more stunning is his  ability to destroy their souls  in a display of his new power one he  doesn't realize he has himself  he lights the two souls on fire making  them cease to exist  ben then turns on him telling him he  could have never helped michael  and now michael has lost the only two  figures who have loved him in life  this betrayal by the ones who loved him  most is likely the catalyst for him  going full  evil madison says they need to go back  to cordelia and tell her what they know  their new supreme is pure  evil but they're interrupted by vivian  michael's biological mother and ben goes  to take care of the crying baby if you  remember from season one  vivian gives birth to two children one  of whom died during the birth  the other being michael she warns  madison and behold quoting a passage  from revelations chapter 13  referring to the antichrist then i saw a  beast with ten  horns and seven heads rising out of the  sea and all who dwell on the earth will  worship him  vivian describes her experience with  michael how crows would circle the house  how  hot it was inside in the arrival of the  black pope  anton levay and his cardinals one of  them being mead  the other played by the actress who  played pepper anton tells him it's time  to remove the scales from his eyes  in the book of revelations there are a  number of references to a dragon  vivian tells them at first she didn't  take the satanist seriously they were  lost souls following a con man from some  circus a nod to freak show everything  seemed fine  until the black mass mead pulls up and  offers a ride to a young girl as don't  fear the reaper plays on the radio the  girl says thanks you're a lifesaver but  we know her life will be far from saved  notice the upside down cross hanging  from the rear view mirror  and the syringe mead stabs the girl with  it's such a lovely night for murder  isn't it the black mass begins with  anton copping a feel and passing a  dagger to one of the cardinals  she tells michael it's all for you  a nod to 1976's the omen  in a scene from temple of doom anton  pulls out the young girl's heart and  it's given to michael to eat  yum and we watch as the shadow of the  devil looms over him  the other satanists bowing in reverence  vivian  fearing what michael has become makes  the decision to kill him as she does she  notices  666 the number of the beasts that was  described in the bible passage vivian  mentioned earlier from revelations her  attempt to kill michael fails as he  engulfs her in flames only for her to be  saved by tate  from that day forward he was gone vivian  says neither ben nor tate were the  father rather he was born from the evil  of the house  the source of darkness is his true  father and he has come to destroy the  world  bringing billie jean's prophecy to  fruition madison and behold prepare to  leave behold telling her that if he had  known michael was this evil they would  never have made him supreme he asked her  what they would do if they can't stop  him a question madison doesn't have the  answer to  violet explains to madison her troubles  with tate and in a real turn for  madison's character  she consoles her telling her that the  real evil isn't tate  rather the house it used him as a vessel  to commit those evil deeds  she thinks that the evil inside tate  left with michael giving violet hope of  a future relationship with her sexy  ghost boy  madison blows some fairy dust so she can  look fabulous and she now magically  knows how tate saved his mom  they embrace as the police spirits of  the material world plays in the  background  madison and behold driving back to  cordelia this episode focused primarily  on backstory in fact it really didn't  advance the plot at all but i was okay  with that since we learned more about  who michael  is and how he became that way his  upbringing was one of tragedy his mother  dying in childbirth and the two people  who cared for him the most turning their  backs on him  it's no wonder when the satanist arrived  telling him he was special that he  turned to them  and embraced his true path but this  episode was a total nostalgia trip for  fans of season 1  getting to reunite with old characters  giving a proper send-off to moira and  constance and finally answering what  made tate so evil  what i'm interested in is how the  witches will use this new information to  gain the upper hand on michael who will  they need to seek out in order to put a  stop to michael for good  we know it won't go over well because  the apocalypse does eventually happen  but with the witches thankfully  surviving  i think the key to all this resides with  mallory in the last episode we saw her  heal  a deer but not only did she heal it it  regained its youth becoming a doe  if michael can banish souls for good can  malory bring them back  is she the key to somehow reverting the  apocalypse  and what will ariel do when he finds out  about michael's true past  remember me told michael not to bring up  who his father was to him and ariel only  wanted michael to be alpha so he could  stick it to the witches  not to mention we still don't know  what's going to happen in the current  timeline cordelia raised cocodina and  mallory from the dead before they were  interrupted by michael  what will he do to them or rather what  will they do to him that's it for this  breakdown  if you liked this video make sure to  give it a like and if you didn't meet me  out back by the gazebo  i also have a new twitter where you can  get updates on my latest videos or if  you just want to troll me and last but  not least because i was a bad boy and  didn't do it last week  i want you all to remember daddy loves  you very much

